#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Welcome to *Foundations of Quantum Error Correction,* the fourth course in the *Understanding Quantum Information and Computation* series comprising the following courses:\n"
msgstr "Selamat datang ke *Asas Pembetulan Ralat Kuantum,* kursus keempat dalam siri *Memahami Maklumat dan Pengiraan Kuantum* yang terdiri daripada kursus-kursus berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Basics of quantum information](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information)\n"
msgstr "[Asas maklumat kuantum](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Fundamentals of quantum algorithms](/learning/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms)\n"
msgstr "[Asas algoritma kuantum](/learning/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[General formulation of quantum information](/learning/courses/general-formulation-of-quantum-information)\n"
msgstr "[Perumusan umum maklumat kuantum](/learning/courses/general-formulation-of-quantum-information)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Foundations of quantum error correction (this course)\n"
msgstr "Asas pembetulan ralat kuantum (kursus ini)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course is on quantum error correction, with a focus on foundational concepts. \n"
"It begins with an explanation of what quantum error correcting codes are and how they work. \n"
"It then moves on to the discretization of errors phenomenon, the stabilizer formalism for \n"
"describing quantum error correcting codes, Calderbank–Shor–Steane (CSS) codes, and several \n"
"key examples of quantum error correcting codes, including the toric code and surface codes. \n"
"The course also discusses fault-tolerant quantum computation, in which quantum computations \n"
"are performed on error-corrected quantum information.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kursus ini berkaitan pembetulan ralat kuantum, dengan tumpuan pada konsep-konsep asas.\n"
"Ia bermula dengan penjelasan tentang apa itu kod pembetulan ralat kuantum dan bagaimana ia berfungsi.\n"
"Kemudian ia beralih kepada fenomena pendigitan ralat, formalisme penstabil untuk\n"
"menerangkan kod pembetulan ralat kuantum, kod Calderbank–Shor–Steane (CSS), dan beberapa\n"
"contoh utama kod pembetulan ralat kuantum, termasuk kod torik dan kod permukaan.\n"
"Kursus ini juga membincangkan pengiraan kuantum tahan-ralat, di mana pengiraan kuantum\n"
"dilakukan pada maklumat kuantum yang telah diperbetulkan ralat.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course is intended for students, professionals, and hobbyists in fields such as computer science, physics, \n"
"engineering, and mathematics who are eager to gain knowledge on the theoretical foundations of quantum information \n"
"and computation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kursus ini ditujukan untuk pelajar, profesional, dan penggemar dalam bidang seperti sains komputer, fizik,\n"
"kejuruteraan, dan matematik yang ingin mendapatkan pengetahuan tentang asas teoritikal maklumat kuantum\n"
"dan pengiraan.\n"

